# Additional native-attested "last/previous" forms, source:
# https://github.com/OpenVoiceOS/ovos-date-parser/issues/300
# darrèr/darrièir attested masculine only; feminine spelling not attested.
# precedent(s) is invariable in gender (standard Occitan -ent adjective).
passat
passada
darrièr
darrièra
darrèr
darrièir
precedent
precedents
